### ============================================
### ПОЛНЫЙ ТЕСТ БАНКОВСКОГО API
### ============================================
### ИНСТРУКЦИЯ:
### 1. Запустите сервер: go run cmd/main.go
### 2. Выполняйте запросы ПО ПОРЯДКУ
### 3. После логина скопируйте ТОКЕН и вставьте вместо TOKEN
### 4. После получения счетов скопируйте ID и вставьте вместо {ACCOUNT_ID}
### 5. После получения кредита скопируйте ID и вставьте вместо {CREDIT_ID}

### ============================================
### 1. ПРОВЕРКА ЗДОРОВЬЯ
### ============================================
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### ============================================
### 2. АУТЕНТИФИКАЦИЯ
### ============================================

### 2.1 Регистрация пользователя
POST http://localhost:8080/api/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "test@example.com",
    "username": "testuser",
    "password": "123456"
}

### 2.2 Логин (скопируйте token из ответа)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "test@example.com",
    "password": "123456"
}

### ============================================
### 3. УПРАВЛЕНИЕ СЧЕТАМИ
### ============================================

### 3.1 Создать RUB счет
POST http://localhost:8080/api/accounts
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "currency": "RUB"
}

### 3.2 Создать USD счет
POST http://localhost:8080/api/accounts
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "currency": "USD"
}

### 3.3 Создать EUR счет
POST http://localhost:8080/api/accounts
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "currency": "EUR"
}

### 3.4 Получить все счета (скопируйте ID счетов)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/accounts
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### ============================================
### 4. ОПЕРАЦИИ СО СЧЕТАМИ
### ============================================

### 4.1 Пополнить RUB счет
POST http://localhost:8080/api/deposit
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "account_id": "RUB_ACCOUNT_ID",
    "amount": 10000,
    "description": "Пополнение через терминал"
}

### 4.2 Пополнить USD счет
POST http://localhost:8080/api/deposit
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "account_id": "USD_ACCOUNT_ID",
    "amount": 500,
    "description": "Пополнение USD"
}

### 4.3 Проверить баланс после пополнения
GET http://localhost:8080/api/accounts
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### 4.4 Снять деньги с RUB счета
POST http://localhost:8080/api/withdraw
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "account_id": "RUB_ACCOUNT_ID",
    "amount": 500,
    "description": "Снятие в банкомате"
}

### ============================================
### 5. ПЕРЕВОДЫ
### ============================================

### 5.1 Перевод RUB -> USD
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transfer
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "from_account_id": "RUB_ACCOUNT_ID",
    "to_account_id": "USD_ACCOUNT_ID",
    "amount": 2000,
    "description": "Конвертация RUB в USD"
}

### 5.2 Перевод RUB -> EUR
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transfer
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "from_account_id": "RUB_ACCOUNT_ID",
    "to_account_id": "EUR_ACCOUNT_ID",
    "amount": 1000,
    "description": "Конвертация RUB в EUR"
}

### ============================================
### 6. ИСТОРИЯ ТРАНЗАКЦИЙ
### ============================================

### 6.1 История RUB счета
GET http://localhost:8080/api/transactions/RUB_ACCOUNT_I
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### 6.2 История USD счета
GET http://localhost:8080/api/transactions/USD_ACCOUNT_ID
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### ============================================
### 7. КАРТЫ
### ============================================

### 7.1 Создать карту для RUB счета
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cards
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "account_id": "RUB_ACCOUNT_ID"
}

### 7.2 Получить все карты RUB счета
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cards?account_id=RUB_ACCOUNT_I
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### 7.3 Создать карту для USD счета
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cards
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "account_id": "USD_ACCOUNT_ID"
}

### ============================================
### 8. КРЕДИТЫ
### ============================================

### 8.1 Оформить кредит 50000 руб на 6 месяцев под 15%
POST http://localhost:8080/api/credits/apply
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "amount": 50000,
    "interest_rate": 15,
    "months": 6
}

### 8.2 Оформить кредит 100000 руб на 12 месяцев под 12%
POST http://localhost:8080/api/credits/apply
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "amount": 100000,
    "interest_rate": 12,
    "months": 12
}

### 8.3 Получить график платежей (вставьте CREDIT_ID из ответа)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/credits/{CREDIT_ID}/schedule
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### ============================================
### 9. АНАЛИТИКА
### ============================================

### 9.1 Дашборд аналитики
GET http://localhost:8080/api/analytics/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### 9.2 Кредитная нагрузка
GET http://localhost:8080/api/analytics/credit-burden
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### 9.3 Прогноз баланса на 30 дней
GET http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/RUB_ACCOUNT_I/predict?days=30
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### 9.4 Прогноз баланса на 90 дней
GET http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/RUB_ACCOUNT_I/predict?days=90
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### ============================================
### 10. ИНТЕГРАЦИИ
### ============================================

### 10.1 Ключевая ставка ЦБ РФ (SOAP)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/central-bank/rate
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### 10.2 Тест email уведомления (SMTP)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/email/test
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### ============================================
### 11. ТЕСТЫ ОШИБОК
### ============================================

### 11.1 Попытка создать счет без токена (401)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{"currency": "RUB"}

### 11.2 Попытка перевести больше чем есть (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transfer
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "from_account_id": "RUB_ACCOUNT_ID",
    "to_account_id": "USD_ACCOUNT_ID",
    "amount": 999999,
    "description": "Сумма больше баланса"
}

### 11.3 Попытка снять больше чем есть (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/withdraw
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "account_id": "RUB_ACCOUNT_ID",
    "amount": 999999,
    "description": "Снятие больше баланса"
}

### 11.4 Попытка перевода на несуществующий счет (404)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transfer
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "from_account_id": "RUB_ACCOUNT_ID",
    "to_account_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
    "amount": 100,
    "description": "На несуществующий счет"
}

### 11.5 Попытка получить чужой счет (403)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/chacun7vb-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### 11.6 Неверный токен (401)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/accounts
Authorization: Bearer invalid.token.here

### ============================================
### 12. ФИНАЛЬНАЯ ПРОВЕРКА
### ============================================

### 12.1 Итоговый баланс всех счетов
GET http://localhost:8080/api/accounts
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### 12.2 Полная история всех транзакций
GET http://localhost:8080/api/transactions/RUB_ACCOUNT_I
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN